---
description: "Flutter localization guardrails"
globs:
  - "app/**/*.dart"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use l10n for all user-facing strings: `context.l10n.keyName`.
- Add, change, or remove a key with `python3 app/scripts/l10n.py` (`add`/`set`/`remove`/`template`/`check`). Do not edit ARB files by hand or with `jq`.
- The caller supplies translations for every locale `template` lists; keep ICU placeholders identical to English.
- The tool regenerates (`flutter gen-l10n`) and formats; do not stop with untranslated messages for the key you just wrote.
- See `app/AGENTS.md` for the localization section.
